# Default: ignore everything so the GitHub-connected mocks project cannot
# publish Compose, Odoo config, or addons as a static site (PR #12).
*
# Phase 0 HTML twin (existing Vercel project, repo-root vercel.json)
!docs/
!docs/superpowers/
!docs/superpowers/mocks/
!docs/superpowers/mocks/**
# Phase 2 BFF (separate Vercel project, Root Directory = middleware/)
!middleware/
!middleware/**
!vercel.json
!.vercelignore
